# UI evidence — before/after screenshots

When changing user-visible UI (layout, styling, copy, sticky/scroll behavior, tables, trays, nav):

1. **Before** — capture screenshots (or a short video) of the current UI in the broken/prior state before editing.
2. **After** — capture the same views after the fix.
3. Prefer **demo mode** (`DEMO_MODE=1`) when live broker data is not required.
4. Store evidence under `docs/pr-evidence/<issue-or-slug>/{before,after}/` as compressed JPEG when possible.
5. After the PR exists, **label evidence with the PR number** (filename and/or on-image badge, e.g. `PR #57`) and link those files in the PR body.
6. Include before/after images in the PR description — do not ship UI-only PRs without visual proof unless capture is impossible (then say why).

Do not skip this for “small” UI tweaks that change layout or scroll/sticky behavior.
